# PORTFOLIO DIAMOND SPRINT — STANDALONE
## 6-Day Professional Sprint (Post-Audit) — Brand New Project

**Sprint Date:** April 2, 2026  
**Target State:** Production-ready developer portfolio at `C:/webdev/portfolio/`  
**Output:** Deployed diamond-layout portfolio, Lighthouse 85+ Performance / 95+ Accessibility  
**Executor:** AI Agent (via /implement, /build, /test delegation)  
**Prerequisites:** This is a **STANDALONE PROJECT** — not within Sang-Logium  
**Audit Reference:** `_project/audits/PORTFOLIO_SPRINT_AUDIT_2026-04-02.md`

