## 🚨 PRE-EXECUTION CHECKLIST (MANDATORY)

**Run these commands before Day 1:**

```bash
# 1. Navigate to webdev folder
cd C:/webdev

# 2. Create standalone Next.js 15 project
npx create-next-app@latest portfolio \
  --typescript \
  --tailwind \
  --eslint \
  --app \
  --src-dir=false \
  --import-alias="@/*"

# 3. Navigate to project
cd portfolio

# 4. Install minimal dependencies
npm install framer-motion lucide-react clsx tailwind-merge

# 5. Install test dependencies
npm install --save-dev @playwright/test @axe-core/playwright

# 6. Verify baseline build
npm run build
# MUST PASS before any sprint work begins
```

**Folder Structure After Setup:**
```
C:/webdev/portfolio/
├── app/
│   ├── page.tsx
│   ├── layout.tsx
│   └── globals.css
├── components/
├── lib/
├── tests/
│   └── e2e/
├── public/
├── tailwind.config.ts
├── next.config.ts
└── package.json
```

