## 📋 SPRINT METADATA

### Scope Lock Rules

| Rule | Enforcement |
|------|-------------|
| **NO** modifications to Sang-Logium | Complete isolation — separate project |
| **NO** shared dependencies | Fresh `package.json` in `portfolio/` |
| **NO** Motion 34kb full bundle | Use `m` + `LazyMotion` (4.6kb) or CSS-first |
| **NO** hardcoded colors in components | All via `tailwind.config.ts` tokens |
| **NO** arbitrary Tailwind values | All utilities from config only |
| **YES** CSS-first animation | `steps()` for typing, `transform` for hover |
| **YES** build passes after every Pass | Never proceed with failing build |
| **YES** 3-file test suite | layout, accessibility, performance |

### Design System Specification

**Color Tokens (tailwind.config.ts):**
```typescript
colors: {
  background: {
    base: "#121212",        // Main background
    surface: "#1A1A1A",     // Card backgrounds
    elevated: "#242424",    // Hover states
  },
  gold: {
    400: "#D4AF37",         // Primary accent
    500: "#C9A962",         // Hover state
    glow: "rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.3)",
  },
  text: {
    primary: "#FFFFFF",
    secondary: "#E0E0E0",
    muted: "#9E9E9E",
  },
}
```

**Typography Tokens:**
```typescript
fontFamily: {
  sans: ["Inter", "system-ui", "sans-serif"],
  mono: ["JetBrains Mono", "monospace"],
}
fontSize: {
  hero: ["clamp(2.5rem, 5vw + 1rem, 4rem)", { lineHeight: "1.1" }],
  h1: ["clamp(2rem, 4vw + 0.5rem, 3rem)", { lineHeight: "1.2" }],
  h2: ["clamp(1.5rem, 3vw + 0.5rem, 2.25rem)", { lineHeight: "1.25" }],
  body: ["1rem", { lineHeight: "1.6" }],
  code: ["0.875rem", { lineHeight: "1.5" }],
}
```

