  - [ ] `AccessibleNavigation.tsx` with `aria-hidden="true"` on visual
  - [ ] `nav` with `sr-only` class containing section links
  - [ ] Semantic: `ul > li > a` structure

- [ ] Pass 3 — Layer 3 (Surface): Visual styling
  - [ ] Diamond border with `--diamond-glow` box-shadow
  - [ ] Dark background `#121212`
  - [ ] Quadrant card styling with hover placeholder

- [ ] Pass 3 — Layer 4 (Interaction): RWD verification
  - [ ] Desktop (1280px): Verified in DevTools
  - [ ] Tablet (768px): Verified in DevTools
  - [ ] Mobile (375px): Verified in DevTools

**Delegation:**
```
/implement "Create diamond layout components in components/diamond/. DiamondContainer.tsx with semantic structure and data-testid attributes. DiamondShape.tsx with CSS clip-path polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%). AccessibleNavigation.tsx with aria-hidden on visual diamond + parallel sr-only navigation. Implement responsive: desktop (1280px) shows diamond with positioned quadrants, tablet (768px) shows centered diamond + 2x2 grid, mobile (375px) hides diamond and stacks quadrants. Apply diamond glow box-shadow and dark background. Verify all 3 breakpoints in DevTools."
```

**Verification:**
