### SC4: Code Typing Animation — CSS-First

**Target State:**
```
portfolio/
├── components/
│   └── diamond/
│       └── ScreenSafeTyping.tsx        # aria-hidden + sr-only
├── app/
│   └── globals.css
│       └── .typing-animation            # CSS keyframes
```

**DoD (Sequenced):**

- [ ] Pass 1: CSS animation skeleton
  ```css
  @keyframes typing {
    from { width: 0; }
    to { width: 100%; }
  }
  .typing-animation {
    overflow: hidden;
    white-space: nowrap;
    animation: typing 3s steps(40) forwards;
  }
  ```

- [ ] Pass 2: Screen-safe implementation
  - [ ] `ScreenSafeTyping.tsx` with `aria-hidden="true"` wrapper
  - [ ] Parallel `sr-only` element with complete code
  ```tsx
  <>
    <div aria-hidden="true">
      <pre className="typing-animation"><code>{code}</code></pre>
    </div>
    <pre className="sr-only"><code>{code}</code></pre>
  </>
  ```

- [ ] Pass 3 — Layer 2 (Structure): Reduced motion
  - [ ] `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` query
  - [ ] `animation: none` + `width: 100%` for reduced motion
  - [ ] `useReducedMotion()` hook integration

- [ ] Pass 3 — Layer 3 (Surface): Visual polish
  - [ ] JetBrains Mono font applied
  - [ ] Color: `text-secondary` (#E0E0E0)
  - [ ] Background: `bg-surface` (#1A1A1A)

- [ ] Pass 3 — Layer 4 (Interaction): Accessibility verification
  - [ ] Screen reader test: hears complete code once (not progressive)
  - [ ] Reduced motion test: static display when enabled

**Delegation:**
```
/implement "Create ScreenSafeTyping.tsx in components/diamond/ with CSS steps() typing animation. CRITICAL: Use aria-hidden on visual animation + sr-only parallel content for screen readers. Add CSS keyframes to globals.css: @keyframes typing { from { width: 0; } to { width: 100%; } }. Add .typing-animation class with overflow: hidden, white-space: nowrap, animation: typing 3s steps(40) forwards. Add @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .typing-animation { animation: none; width: 100%; } }. Apply JetBrains Mono font and dark theme colors. Test with VoiceOver/NVDA: should hear complete code once, not progressive 'c... co... con...'."
```

**Verification:**
```bash
npm run build
npx playwright test tests/accessibility.spec.ts
# Manual: Screen reader test
```

