**DoD (Sequenced):**

- [ ] Pass 1: Flagship section skeleton
  - [ ] `FlagshipSection.tsx` component
  - [ ] Stats: products, components, tests, months
  - [ ] Innovation list (5 items)
  - [ ] Stack badges (Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind, etc.)

- [ ] Pass 2: Footer + final assembly
  - [ ] `FooterSection.tsx` with social links (GitHub, LinkedIn, Email)
  - [ ] `page.tsx` assembling all sections
