  - [ ] `next.config.ts` with `output: 'export'`
  - [ ] `dist/` folder generated
  - [ ] Fonts optimized

- [ ] Pass 3 — Layer 4 (Interaction): Deploy
  - [ ] Deploy to Netlify/Vercel
  - [ ] Custom domain configured (optional)

- [ ] Pass 3 — Verification Gates:
  - [ ] **Lighthouse:** Performance 85+, Accessibility 95+, Best Practices 95+, SEO 90+
  - [ ] **Screen Reader:** Manual test passed
  - [ ] **Cross-browser:** Chrome, Firefox, Safari verified

**Delegation:**
