## ⚠️ REGRESSION CONTAINMENT

### Pre-Sprint Baseline

```bash
# EXECUTE BEFORE DAY 1:
cd C:/webdev
npx create-next-app@latest portfolio --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app --src-dir=false --import-alias="@/*"
cd portfolio
npm install framer-motion lucide-react clsx tailwind-merge
