### Recovery Patterns

```bash
# Build gate — never proceed with failing build
npm run build

# Git checkpoints after each Pass
git add .
git commit -m "PASS 1: Diamond skeleton complete"

# Recovery to last known good
git reset --hard HEAD~1
```

